    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. what about edge cases though? sometimes we find these weird little glitches or elements that just don't behave right during testing, like things being hidden from the screen reader even when they seem fine. how do i track those down or categorize them in an audit report?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
