    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the template idea. another thing—when we're doing these audits, we sometimes run into stuff that feels almost intentional, like a button's hit area is just slightly off or a hover state doesn't trigger for certain users. it's like these tiny little bugs are just lurking in the code waiting to mess things up. do you have any tips on how to deal with those kinds of persistent, sneaky issues that seem to pop up out of nowhere?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
