      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For intentional design choices, always check if the \"focus trap\" is correctly implemented and if the minimum touch target is at least 44x44 pixels on all devices. Instead of chasing every out-of-scope bug, create a specific \"User Experience vs. Accessibility\" section in your report to distinguish between genuine failures and creative design decisions. Prioritize manual testing with diverse input methods (keyboard, voice, and switch access) to expose the most persistent, sneaky issues before they reach production.",
